This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the Airbnb React/JSX Style Guide as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

The Airbnb React/JSX Style Guide is published by Airbnb under the MIT License. The
rule text re-expressed here in items' `text`/`attrs.source_ref` is derived from that
guide and remains the work of Airbnb and its contributors; this repository claims no
ownership over that content and reproduces it for interoperability. See
https://airbnb.io/javascript/react/ for the authoritative source.
